@page "/gantt/api"

<DocHeader Slug="gantt" Page="api" />

<div class="doc-section">
    <h2>NxGantt</h2>
    <div class="doc-table-wrap">
        <table class="doc-table doc-api-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>Data</td><td>IEnumerable&lt;TItem&gt;?</td><td>—</td><td>Every task, flat.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>ItemId</td><td>Func&lt;TItem, object&gt;</td><td>required</td><td>A task's unique id.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>ParentId</td><td>Func&lt;TItem, object?&gt;?</td><td>—</td><td>Its parent's id; <code>null</code> (or not passed) at the top.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>ItemTitle</td><td>Func&lt;TItem, string?&gt;?</td><td>—</td><td>The bar's text.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>ItemStart / ItemEnd</td><td>Func&lt;TItem, DateTime?&gt;</td><td>required</td><td>The bar's times; the end is where the bar stops. A task without a start has no bar.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Columns</td><td>RenderFragment?</td><td>—</td><td>The <code>NxGanttColumn</code>s.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Dependencies</td><td>IEnumerable&lt;NxGanttDependency&gt;?</td><td>—</td><td>Links, drawn as arrows: <code>new NxGanttDependency(predecessorId, successorId, type)</code>; the type defaults to finish-to-start.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>SlotWidth</td><td>double</td><td>30</td><td>Pixels per day: the zoom.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>DayHeaderDateFormat</td><td>string</td><td>{0:%d}</td><td>A day's header.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>WeekHeaderTemplate / DayHeaderTemplate</td><td>RenderFragment&lt;DateTime&gt;?</td><td>—</td><td>The timeline's header cells.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>TaskTemplate</td><td>RenderFragment&lt;TItem&gt;?</td><td>title</td><td>A bar's content; it fills the bar.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>TooltipTemplate</td><td>RenderFragment&lt;TItem&gt;?</td><td>title + dates</td><td>Under a bar while the pointer is on it.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>TreeListWidth</td><td>string?</td><td>40%</td><td>The task list's width; <code>@@bind-TreeListWidth</code> hears the divider (<code>"420px"</code>).</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Sortable</td><td>bool</td><td>false</td><td>Header clicks sort among siblings: ascending, descending, off.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>FilterRow</td><td>bool</td><td>false</td><td>Filter boxes: tasks containing the text, with their parents.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>ExpandedItems</td><td>IEnumerable&lt;TItem&gt;?</td><td>all</td><td><code>@@bind-ExpandedItems</code>; <code>null</code> expands every task.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>SelectedItems</td><td>IEnumerable&lt;TItem&gt;?</td><td>none</td><td><code>@@bind-SelectedItems</code>: the selected task, in a list of one or none (as NxGrid's).</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Editable</td><td>bool</td><td>true</td><td><code>false</code> turns off cell editors, dragging bars, drawing dependencies and Delete.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>ToolBarTemplate</td><td>RenderFragment?</td><td>—</td><td>A toolbar over the Gantt.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Height / Width</td><td>string?</td><td>600px / —</td><td>CSS sizes.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Culture / AriaLabel / Id / Class / Style</td><td></td><td>—</td><td>Dates, the task list's name ("Tasks"), the outer element.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="doc-section">
    <h2>NxGanttColumn</h2>
    <div class="doc-table-wrap">
        <table class="doc-table doc-api-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>Value</td><td>Func&lt;TItem, object?&gt;?</td><td>—</td><td>The value shown; also what the column sorts and filters on.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Title</td><td>string?</td><td>—</td><td>The header.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Width</td><td>string?</td><td>120px</td><td>Pixels.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>DisplayFormat</td><td>string?</td><td>—</td><td><code>{0:MM/dd/yy}</code> or <code>MM/dd/yy</code>.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Expandable</td><td>bool</td><td>false</td><td>Holds the tree's arrows and indent.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Visible / Editable / Filterable</td><td>bool</td><td>true</td><td>Shown; edited in place (with an <code>EditorTemplate</code>); a filter box.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Template / EditorTemplate</td><td>RenderFragment&lt;TItem&gt;?</td><td>—</td><td>The cell, and the cell while edited.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>HeaderTemplate</td><td>RenderFragment?</td><td>—</td><td>The header's content.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="doc-section">
    <h2>Events &amp; Methods</h2>
    <div class="doc-table-wrap">
        <table class="doc-table doc-api-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Member</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>OnEdit</td><td>EventCallback&lt;TItem&gt;</td><td>Double-click on a row or bar, Enter on a row: open your form.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>OnUpdate</td><td>EventCallback&lt;NxGanttUpdateArgs&lt;TItem&gt;&gt;</td><td>Any edit, as NxGrid's: a bar dragged or resized (the item is untouched) or a cell left (its editor wrote it). Bars drag only with a handler.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>NxGanttUpdateArgs</td><td>Item, Kind, Start, End, OldValue, NewValue</td><td><code>Kind</code> is Edit, Move, ResizeStart or ResizeEnd; <code>Start</code> and <code>End</code> are the dates a dragged bar asks for (<code>null</code> when one stays): write them to the item. For a cell, <code>OldValue</code> and <code>NewValue</code> are its column's value before and after.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>OnDelete</td><td>EventCallback&lt;TItem&gt;</td><td>Delete on the selected row: remove the task from <code>Data</code>.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>OnDependencyCreate</td><td>EventCallback&lt;NxGanttDependencyCreateEventArgs&lt;TItem&gt;&gt;</td><td>A link drawn from one bar to another: <code>Predecessor</code>, <code>Successor</code>, <code>Type</code>.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>OnStateChanged</td><td>EventCallback</td><td>The sort or a filter changed.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>TreeListWidthChanged / ExpandedItemsChanged / SelectedItemsChanged</td><td>EventCallback</td><td>The divider moved; a task opened or closed; another task was selected.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>HasSort / HasFilter</td><td>bool</td><td>A sort or a filter is on.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>ClearSortAsync() / ClearFilterAsync()</td><td>Task</td><td>Back to the data's order; empty the filters.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Rebind()</td><td>void</td><td>Draws again after the data changed in place outside a render.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="doc-section">
    <h2>CSS Variables</h2>
    <div class="doc-table-wrap">
        <table class="doc-table doc-api-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Variable</th><th>Default</th><th>Used for</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>--nx-gantt-row-height</td><td>36px</td><td>A task row.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-gantt-head-height / -filter-height</td><td>56px / 40px</td><td>The headers and the filter row.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-gantt-head-bg / -line</td><td>--nx-surface-hover / #e6e6ea</td><td>Headers; grid lines.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-gantt-weekend-bg / -today</td><td>#f6f6f8 / --nx-danger</td><td>Weekend days; today's line.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-gantt-bar-bg / -bar-fg / -summary-bg</td><td>accent / accent-fg / #5f6b73</td><td>Bars without a template; summary (parent) bars.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-gantt-link</td><td>#6b6b78</td><td>Dependency arrows.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-gantt-grip-width / -grip-bg</td><td>7px / white 35% (dark: black 30%)</td><td>The strip at each end of a bar that resizes it.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-gantt-ghost-bg</td><td>the bar color at 14%</td><td>The outline that shows where a dragged bar will land.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</div>

